{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42618","headline":"送张相公出征 · 杨夔","name":"送张相公出征","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"得意在当年，登坛秉国权。\n汉推周勃重，晋让赵宣贤。\n儒德尼丘降，兵钤太白传。\n援毫飞凤藻，发匣吼龙泉。\n历火金难耗，零霜桂益坚。\n从来称玉洁，此更让朱妍。\n鸳鹭臻门下，貔貅拥帐前。\n去知清朔漠，行不费陶甄。\n献画符中旨，推诚契上玄。\n愿将班固笔，书颂勒燕然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨夔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42618.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42618","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}